# Home page blocks. Public, no sign-in needed.
# Each block lists up to 12 products that can be bought right now (an active
# offer with an available key), best sellers first, priced by their cheapest
# buyable offer. Blocks with no such products are left out.

### Home
# 200 {"blocks": [{"title": "Most popular games", "productTypes": ["game"], "products": [...]}, ...]}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home
